IAT SCRIPT
Script for checking Import Address Table under the WinDbg.

Save it on C:/ as iat.wds — a source.

=============================================
r $t0 = poi(${$arg1}+poi(${$arg1}+0x3c)+0xd8)
r $t1 = poi(${$arg1}+poi(${$arg1}+0x3c)+0xdc)
dps ${$arg1}+$t0 l? (($t1+4)/4)

Use it in WinDbg like this:

$$>a<c:\iat.wds app_name
